<title>MONGOLIA: Mongolia's tugrik down 0.01 pct vs dollar to Monday.</title>
<headline>Mongolia's tugrik down 0.01 pct vs dollar to Monday.</headline>
<dateline>ULAN BATOR 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mongolia's tugrik fell 0.0112 percent against the dollar on Monday compared with the previous Monday, central bank figures showed.</p>
<p>The Bank of Mongolia said the tugrik had fallen to 804.45 against the U.S. currency, from 804.36 a week ago.</p>
<p>The central bank calculates the official rate based on the previous week's interbank trade.</p>
<p>-- Ulan Bator Newsroom (976) 1-312 565</p>
</text>
